  "rating": 3.5,
  "description": "Follows Ben Reilly, a private investigator in New York who was once the masked hero known as The Spider. Forces Ben to return to his superhero identity when a dangerous investigation draws him into New York's criminal underworld and a series of mysterious super powered individuals. Explores Ben's wartime, revealing that his powers originated during World War I, when he was exposed to German experiments involving genetically altered soldiers and a spider-like mutant. A darker, live-action interpretation of Spider-Man, blending superhero elements with 1930s crime noir, organised crime and detective storytelling. Explores themes of redemption, grief, identity and responsibility as Ben attempts to reconcile the man he has become with the hero he once was."},
